'''Dervish [[Primeval armor]]''' is a [[Prestige armor|prestige]] art type available in the Nightfall campaign.

This armor is only available in the [[Throne of Secrets]], an [[explorable area]] only accessible by completing [[Abaddon's Gate|the final mission]] in Nightfall. If you plan on buying this armor make sure you take all of the required crafting materials and money into the mission with you, as there are no [[Xunlai Agent]]s, [[material trader]]s, or [[rare material trader]]s available in the zone.

There is no standard version of Primeval armor.

